    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.2/5</span><span class="text-gray-500">Long-running global VPS + dedicated hosting</span></div><p class="text-gray-300">ServerHub (founded 2002) sells IronGrid Pure SSD and IronGrid SSD-Cached VPS plans starting at $5/month, with 9 confirmed data centers spanning the US (Phoenix, Dallas ×2, Chicago, Seattle, NYC, Los Angeles) and Europe (Frankfurt, Amsterdam). Every VPS plan runs on a 10 Gbit network port with instant virtualization, RAID-10 storage, full root access, and the same Juniper + Cisco backbone that powers the company's dedicated server line.</p><p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Pure SSD entry: $5/mo Starter (2 vCPU, 1 GB RAM, 50 GB SSD, 1 TB) · SSD-Cached entry: $5/mo (512 MB RAM, 500 GB cache, 1 TB)</p></div>
